note a tiny website with two pages
when someone visits the path home do
show a heading with the words Welcome to my site end words
show a paragraph with the words Built in plain English. end words
reply with the page
end when
when someone visits the path hello do
let who be the visitor sent name
if who is the words end words then
reply with the words Hello, stranger. end words
otherwise
reply with the words Hello end words followed by who
end if
end when
start the server on port 8099
